The KALIED demo just draws patterns on the 611.

The KALEID demo is started with the command:
	.EX KALEID

While it is running, it is best to start by lowering all 12 input
switches on the front panel, then experiment with raising and
lowering switches 9, 10, and 11 (on the right) until a pleasing
effect is generated.

A Control-C character should be typed to exit back to the dot prompt.
